C76's head-to-head protocol, run against C90's configuration.
docs/plans/platform-corrections.md C76, C88, C89, C90.
games=200 per (budget,seed) cell; 2 seeds; mirrorSeats=true (default).
Candidate = DUCT selection + leaf evaluation (rolloutCapPlies:0), C85-fixed heuristic.
Legacy = mctsPolicyLegacy default (rolloutCapPlies:200) — max-max, as shipped.
Report is W/D/L — never a bare win rate (Bid-Tac-Toe draws heavily).

=== bid-tac-toe: Candidate (DUCT+leaf, C90) vs Legacy (mctsPolicyLegacy, pre-DUCT max-max) ===
